==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawns, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Zomboe]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This really isn't a difficult stage - most of the enemies will burrow past your frontline, meaning you can rush the base with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] very easily.

